title: AdviseCare - State Machine - Erasure Request
---

stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> pending : consent withdrawn and attribute no longer granted anywhere
    pending --> completed : Steward executes (key destroyed, values cleared)
    pending --> pending : refused while the attribute is shared again (409)
    completed --> [*]
    note right of completed
        ATTRIBUTEKEYS.status = destroyed
        STUDENTDATA rows stay, marked erased
    end note
